### API 1: Get All Gardeners
GET http://localhost:3000/gardeners/

### API 2: Get One Specific Gardener (ID: 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/gardeners/1/

### API 2 (Not Found): Get Non-Existent Gardener (ID: 999)
GET http://localhost:3000/gardeners/999/

### API 3: Get All Plots
GET http://localhost:3000/plots/

### API 3 (Search): Search Plots by Soil Type (Query Parameter)
GET http://localhost:3000/plots/?soil_type=Loamy

### API 4: Get One Specific Plot (ID: 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/plots/1/

### API 4 (Not Found): Get Non-Existent Plot (ID: 999)
GET http://localhost:3000/plots/999/

### API 5 (Twist Test 1): Add "Plot 9" -> Expected: 201 "Plot Successfully Added"
POST http://localhost:3000/plots/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Plot 9",
  "soil_type": "Loamy",
  "size_sq_m": 45
}

### API 5 (Twist Test 2): Add lowercase "plot 9" -> Expected: 409 "Plot 9 already exists"
POST http://localhost:3000/plots/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "plot 9",
  "soil_type": "Clay",
  "size_sq_m": 30
}

### API 5 (Validation Test): Empty Plot Name -> Expected: 400 "Invalid Plot Details"
POST http://localhost:3000/plots/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "soil_type": "Loamy",
  "size_sq_m": 25
}

### API 5 (Validation Test): Invalid Size (Negative) -> Expected: 400 "Invalid Plot Details"
POST http://localhost:3000/plots/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Plot 10",
  "soil_type": "Sandy",
  "size_sq_m": -5
}

### API 6 (Twist Test 3): Rename Plot 2 to "PLOT 9" -> Expected: 409 "Plot 9 already exists"
PUT http://localhost:3000/plots/2/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PLOT 9",
  "soil_type": "Clay",
  "size_sq_m": 35
}

### API 6: Update Plot 1 (Same Name - Must Not Conflict With Itself) -> Expected: 200 "Plot Updated"
PUT http://localhost:3000/plots/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Plot 1",
  "soil_type": "Enriched Loam",
  "size_sq_m": 22
}

### API 6 (Not Found): Update Non-Existent Plot (ID: 999) -> Expected: 404 "Plot Not Found"
PUT http://localhost:3000/plots/999/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Plot",
  "soil_type": "Silty",
  "size_sq_m": 10
}

### API 7: Delete a Plot (ID: 3) -> Expected: 200 "Plot Deleted"
DELETE http://localhost:3000/plots/3/

### API 7 (Not Found): Delete Non-Existent Plot (ID: 999) -> Expected: 404 "Plot Not Found"
DELETE http://localhost:3000/plots/999/

### API 8: Get Leases with Gardener and Plot Names (INNER JOIN)
GET http://localhost:3000/leases/

